# Sound Blaster Katana V2X / V2: keep ModemManager off its serial port.
#
# Plugged in by USB, the soundbar exposes a CDC ACM control port. By USB class
# that is an "Abstract (modem)" interface, so an active ModemManager probes it
# with AT commands -- not something to send to a soundbar.
#
# Until 2026-10-07 this rule also tagged the port `uaccess`, because ambience-rgb
# drove the light bar through it. The soundbar is driven through Home Assistant
# now (over Bluetooth), nothing opens this port, and so nobody is granted it.
# Verify with `udevadm info /dev/ttyACM0 | grep ID_MM_DEVICE_IGNORE`.
SUBSYSTEM=="tty", ATTRS{idVendor}=="041e", ATTRS{idProduct}=="3283", ENV{ID_MM_DEVICE_IGNORE}="1"
SUBSYSTEM=="tty", ATTRS{idVendor}=="041e", ATTRS{idProduct}=="3260", ENV{ID_MM_DEVICE_IGNORE}="1"
